msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……들려……."

#: search:search_53E12C05_26DB_47D1_9EB4_35E31462CE24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3bfd694bc7eac0165a6affcf1168cdd2d00e75b3e7de186d8530b9c3a094a14
