msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아 그래, ⟪k:2⟫다행이네."

#: search:search_AA1E2BF7_D662_4D19_BFD8_D0B8B08D191A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7891eecb04c9cbea3262cc399b8c01e6abd96cf4c01adab54c8d252f6944de8
#. default-sha256: 82aeb9d9bb9ac957734d09926e7260ab384b06faa1c784e9abadf86cbf51facc
msgctxt "search:search_AA1E2BF7_D662_4D19_BFD8_D0B8B08D191A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Been so long since I’ve had a conversation,⟪k:1⟫I was afraid I might’ve forgotten how to "
"talk.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So tell me, who might you be?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫오랜 시간 동안 ⟪k:1⟫대화를 못 했다 보니……, ⟪k:2⟫말하는 법도 잊을 뻔했어. ⟪k:3⟫얘, ⟪k:4⟫그런"
"데 넌 누구야?"

#: search:search_E1EF2AD4_F041_48C4_AB86_840D600A6EB6
