msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……모르겠어, ⟪k:2⟫아무것도……."

#: search:search_4D53616D_8E16_476F_8EAA_1318DB2A3890
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9098f4b54a6d84cce7c4a7acf2c6ced7d830bd3eb67f80106b48fb25d0259907
