msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You don’t know?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Well, isn’t that quite the pickle."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫모르겠다고? ⟪k:2⟫그래, ⟪k:3⟫그거 힘들겠다."

#: search:search_8833BD8D_AEEA_4661_B533_6DE38CFDC60E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da47c0104bd99f9dd174b0a054509093faf1aeac36a33789e0bc4c9f61991997
